    speaker: 
    target: {fileID: 0}
    cutscene: {fileID: 0}
    point: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  - kind: 1
    seconds: 0
    id: cs11_01
    text: Miss? Miss, you can't... You've got no face on.
    speaker: ATTENDANT
    target: {fileID: 0}
    cutscene: {fileID: 0}
    point: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  - kind: 1
    seconds: 0
    id: cs11_02
    text: Here. Hold on. We sell them, here, take one, no charge.
    speaker: ATTENDANT
    target: {fileID: 0}
    cutscene: {fileID: 0}
    point: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  - kind: 1
    seconds: 0
    id: cs11_03
    text: ...Bare-faced.
    speaker: ATTENDANT
    target: {fileID: 0}
    cutscene: {fileID: 0}
    point: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  - kind: 1
    seconds: 0
    id: cs11_04
    text: Okay. Okay, that's, uh. That's you.
    speaker: ATTENDANT
    target: {fileID: 0}
    cutscene: {fileID: 0}
    point: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  - kind: 1
    seconds: 0
    id: cs11_05
    text: I'm not gonna do anything. I'm just gonna...
    speaker: ATTENDANT
    target: {fileID: 0}
    cutscene: {fileID: 0}
    point: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  - kind: 1
    seconds: 0
    id: cs11_06
    text: You will obey!
    speaker: QUEEN
    target: {fileID: 0}
    cutscene: {fileID: 0}
    point: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
